# Copy this file to `.env` only if you need to override the default values.
# `.env` must never be committed to git.

# FastAPI backend address.
#
# You normally DON'T need to set this: the client infers the address on its
# own from the Metro server host (the phone already knows the laptop's IP it
# loaded the bundle from). See `src/config/env.ts`.
#
# Set it manually only if the backend runs on a different machine than
# Metro, or if you're using an Android emulator (where the host is 10.0.2.2).
#
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://192.168.1.8:8000
